How to prepare S-26 Gold One Properly:
&#xD;
Warning: Unboiled water, unboiled bottles or incorrect dilution can make your baby ill. Incorrect storage, handling, preparation and feeding can potentially lead to adverse effects on the health of your baby.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Wash your hands before preparing baby&#x2019;s formula. &#xD;
Wash bottle, teat and cap thoroughly until no milk remains. &#xD;
Boil for five minutes. Leave covered until use. &#xD;
Boil drinking water for five minutes; allow to cool. &#xD;
Consult feeding table, pour exact amount of lukewarm water into the bottle. &#xD;
Use only the scoop from this container (Powder must be levelled). &#xD;
Consult feeding table, add exact number of level scoops for age of baby. &#xD;
Cap bottle and shake well until powder is fully dissolved. &#xD;
Close can tightly after each use and store in a cool, dry place. Use within 4 weeks of opening.&#xD;
&#xD;
Storage:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Prepare only one bottle at a time. Feed immediately and follow the instructions exactly. Do not keep the unfinished bottle, discard the contents.&#xD;
Close the can tightly after each use and store in a cool, dry place. Use within 4 weeks after opening. &#xD;
Fill is by weight, not volume. Some settling of the powder may occur.&#xD;

