Ingredients Needed:
&#xD;
&#xD;
1 bottle of Elmer's Glitter Glue Black&#xD;
1 bottle of Elmer's Glitter Glue Green&#xD;
1 bottle of Elmer's Glitter Glue Orange&#xD;
1 bottle Elmer's Magical Liquid (8.75oz)&#xD;
Big bowl for mixing (not included)&#xD;
Spoon (not included)&#xD;
&#xD;
Directions:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Pour all the contents of one(1) Elmer's Glitter Glue into the bowl.&#xD;
Add 1/3 contents of Elmer's Magical Liquid.&#xD;
Mix all ingredients until the slime is formed&#xD;
Repeat steps 1 to 3 for the remaining two(2) Elmer's Glitter Glue bottles.&#xD;
Lay the three(3) slime together side by side, then twirl the slimes together&#xD;
Enjoy your own Elmer's Creepy Slime&#xD;

